				<r3d:description language="eng">The Scientific Data Center of CAS Data Repository is a research data repository for the Scientific Data Center of the Chinese Academy of Sciences. It supports the discovery, publication, access, and reuse of scientific data resources from CAS-related research activities and scientific data center workflows.

The repository provides resource search, metadata description, data access and download services, topic-based data collections, usage statistics, dataset-level licensing information, and persistent identifiers such as DOI and CSTR. It is powered by InstDB v3.0.1, an institutional data repository platform developed by the Computer Network Information Center, Chinese Academy of Sciences (CNIC, CAS).</r3d:description>
